  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A talc-free, lightweight translucent powder that sets makeup undetectably for eight hours while also smoothing, brightening, and blurring your complexion.<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Natural <br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Powder <br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid and Squalane: Molecules that lock in moisture to hydrate. <br>- Jojoba Esters: A lipid-rich desert plant that creates a flexible film on skin to extend wear. <br>- Hectorite and Silica: Minerals that provide a soft-focus blurring effect and help absorb sebum.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Your effortless setting and retouching step for a skin-like, natural-radiant finish.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-If in between shades, select the lighter option as shades appear lighter in the pan. <br>-Lightly swirl The All-Over Powder Brush (sold separately) on the Slip Tint™ Powder pan.<br>-Gently sweep all over to brighten, blur, and set makeup for up to eight hours. <br>-Retouch your look as needed. <br>-SaieGlow™ pro-artist tip: Pair with award-winning Glowy Super Gel™ Lightweight Illuminator (sold separately) and Slip Tint™ Tinted Moisturizer (sold separately) for a radiant, effortless complexion.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hyaluronic Acid and Squalane: Molecules that lock in moisture to hydrate. <br>-Jojoba Esters: A lipid-rich desert plant that creates a flexible film on skin to extend wear. <br>-Hectorite and Silica: Minerals that provide a soft-focus blurring effect and help absorb sebum.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Squalane, Jojoba Esters, Hectorite, Octyldodecanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Sorbate, Cellulose, Boron Nitride, Alumina, Glycerin, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Aqua/Water/Eau, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Tocopherol, Tin Oxide.  [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163), Red 7 (Ci 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A talc-free, lightweight translucent powder that sets makeup undetectably for eight hours while also smoothing, brightening, and blurring your complexion.<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Natural <br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Powder <br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid and Squalane: Molecules that lock in moisture to hydrate. <br>- Jojoba Esters: A lipid-rich desert plant that creates a flexible film on skin to extend wear. <br>- Hectorite and Silica: Minerals that provide a soft-focus blurring effect and help absorb sebum.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Your effortless setting and retouching step for a skin-like, natural-radiant finish.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-If in between shades, select the lighter option as shades appear lighter in the pan. <br>-Lightly swirl The All-Over Powder Brush (sold separately) on the Slip Tint™ Powder pan.<br>-Gently sweep all over to brighten, blur, and set makeup for up to eight hours. <br>-Retouch your look as needed. <br>-SaieGlow™ pro-artist tip: Pair with award-winning Glowy Super Gel™ Lightweight Illuminator (sold separately) and Slip Tint™ Tinted Moisturizer (sold separately) for a radiant, effortless complexion.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hyaluronic Acid and Squalane: Molecules that lock in moisture to hydrate. <br>-Jojoba Esters: A lipid-rich desert plant that creates a flexible film on skin to extend wear. <br>-Hectorite and Silica: Minerals that provide a soft-focus blurring effect and help absorb sebum.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Squalane, Jojoba Esters, Hectorite, Octyldodecanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Sorbate, Cellulose, Boron Nitride, Alumina, Glycerin, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Aqua/Water/Eau, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Tocopherol, Tin Oxide.  [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163), Red 7 (Ci 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
